     * `CacheStore::with_dir` + `load_from_disk` seam (math unchanged); the Kotlin call-site swaps
     * to this method on the Socio's bindgen regen. Panic-firewalled → `Err(Panic)`.
     */
    fun `start`(): kotlin.Int
    
    /**
